{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imagine a reality where strange metallic beings suddenly fall from the sky with strange deadly weapons, and all you can defend yourself with are swords and bows. This unknown and powerful threat is something Egypt and the Roman Empire must soon face. Our adventure begins as Xalos, a Venishien war machine! Where sci-fi meets medieval, experience a epic clash between Xalos, Cleopatra, and Caesar in a top-down side-scroller. Play as Xalos  as you charge into combat and summoning your robot army as you duke it out against the mighty soldiers of Egypt and Rome!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 main gameplay levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 classes and upgrades to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">high quality voice acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">cutscenes with voice acting dialogue</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The goal of this is to bring a short but memorable experience as you play in a spare hour or lunch break.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3373520?t=1741406034","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3373520?t=1741406034","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373520/2abf6611a767f7b2842417272e798815a5dacfb2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741406034","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373520/2abf6611a767f7b2842417272e798815a5dacfb2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741406034","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imagine a reality where strange metallic beings suddenly fall from the sky with strange de